~ penguin_wins

Pigeon: Wait... I lost?
Penguin: Victory is mine.
Penguin: The rooftop belongs to the cold now.
Pigeon: This is so unfair...

Penguin: Better luck next time, sky racer.

=> END

~ pigeon_wins

Pigeon: Ha! Victory is mine!
Penguin: Impossible... how did you beat me?

Pigeon: So... what should I do with my glorious win?

- Celebrate like a champion => res1
- Be nice and spare the penguin => res2

~ res1
Pigeon: This rooftop is officially MY kingdom now.
Penguin: I will return... stronger.
=> END


~ res2
Pigeon: You fought well. We can share the roof.
Penguin: ...I did not expect mercy.
Penguin: Thank you, rival.
=> END

~ draw
Penguin: You look like you have some wings to flap. 
Penguin: You were lucky that the match ended in draw. I'll crush you in the next round.
Penguin: If you are brave enough to handle one more round with me.

- Accept defeat => penguin_wins
- Continue battling => restart

~ restart
do GameManager.restart_minigame.emit()

=> END

~ last_chance
Penguin:  You. I don't like you. But I can give you one last chance.
Penguin: My bro is very sick. So take your feathered butt and get some super rare, nit scatetered acrosss all make branchess.
Penguin: You have 20 mins to do it. I won't repeat. Now shush and get to work.

do GameManager.lost_minigame.emit()
=> END